### Sign in first
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mohna1@example.com",
  "password": "Hello123"
}

### Create comment
POST http://localhost:3000/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postId": "REPLACE_WITH_POST_UUID",
  "content": "This is a comment on the post"
}

### Get all comments for a specific post
GET http://localhost:3000/comments/post/REPLACE_WITH_POST_UUID

### Edit comment
PATCH http://localhost:3000/comments/REPLACE_WITH_COMMENT_UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Updated comment content"
}

### Delete comment
DELETE http://localhost:3000/comments/REPLACE_WITH_COMMENT_UUID
